{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55495","headline":"题越台 · 张洎","name":"题越台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我爱真人居，高台倚寥泬。\n洞天开两扉，邈尔与世绝。\n缥缈乘鸾女，华颜映绿发。\n举手拂烟虹，吹笙弄松月，森萝窥万像，境异趣亦别。\n何必服金丹，飞身向蓬阙。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷十五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张洎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}